# The .NET WebAssembly runtime under public/dotnet/ is integrity-checked against
# SHA-256 hashes in blazor.boot.json. Git end-of-line normalization (autocrlf)
# would rewrite the text-based files (dotnet.native.js, blazor.boot.json, ...),
# changing their bytes so the hashes no longer match — which makes the runtime
# refuse to load in production while still working locally. Treat every file in
# that folder as binary so git preserves the exact bytes.
public/dotnet/** binary

# Belt-and-suspenders: never normalize the WASM app-bundle asset types anywhere.
*.wasm binary
*.dat binary
*.blat binary
